c=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092851703377825792215398.jpeg/2RVO9KNFiSn4BW7kK72DP8S9S7tvn10K9FyojvRcqI4\" alt=\"（IG@setchu.official）\"><figcaption>（IG@setchu.official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092851705634492416246739.jpeg/qmL1MRdQBuBlvII1p4ygUdgoffTOwhHZhIn8noSJ_J4\" alt=\"（IG@setchu.official）\"><figcaption>（IG@setchu.official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092851698369564672985376.jpeg/BdY-za033qksEW7uApHHVUREOXlN3QZsg_hdcIP4XXA\" alt=\"（IG@setchu.official）\"><figcaption>（IG@setchu.official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092851703365242880756094.jpeg/tSUSR2snKtE74pfhQfOcnHWu1ym6vguj4kTymOJE8pg\" alt=\"（IG@setchu.official）\"><figcaption>（IG@setchu.official）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>日本今年搖晃次數倍增 專家指危險訊號：南海海槽地震機率攀升</p><p>日本吃不到道地異國菜了？簽證門檻大飆升 外籍老闆缺錢缺人爆歇業潮</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-13T04:20:17.644338+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1430,"images":25,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}